# Generated Flutter web output.
# These files are produced by `flutter build web` into build/web and are
# copied to public/ for Vercel. Committing a copy of them under web/ makes
# `flutter build web` copy the stale copy OVER the fresh output - that is how a
# 26.9.07 bundle stayed live for weeks. Only real templates belong in web/:
# index.html, manifest.json, favicon.png, icons/, robots.txt, ads.txt and the
# hand-written flutter_service_worker.js.
/web/assets/
/web/canvaskit/
/web/main.dart.js
/web/flutter_bootstrap.js
/web/flutter.js
/web/flutter_service_worker.js.map
/web/.last_build_id
/web/version.json
/build/web/assets/.env
/public/assets/.env
/public/.env

